<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables-.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables-.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange on Friday said  stocks that were unavailable for trading were Patina Oil &amp; Gas Corp  regular, preferred and warrants and Snyder Oil Corp regular and preferred.</p>
<p>Also unavailable were Angelica Corp, Huntingdon Life and Buenos Aires  Embotelladora SA.</p>
<p>Those unavailable for news were Tyco International Ltd and AGL Resources  Inc.</p>
